  "description": "<p class=\"\" data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"567\">De <strong data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"307\">Fitbit Charge 3</strong> is een stijlvolle en slimme <strong data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"356\">activity tracker</strong> met uitgebreide gezondheidsfuncties. Volg je hartslag, stappen, calorieverbruik, slaap en meer – alles overzichtelijk weergegeven via het heldere touchscreen. Perfect voor dagelijks gebruik en sportieve doelen.</p>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"713\">Dit exemplaar is <strong data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"604\">in nette staat</strong>, wat betekent <strong data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"675\">amper gedragen met slechts minimale gebruikerssporen</strong>. Volledig getest en 100% functioneel.</p>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"829\">✅ Hartslag, stappen, slaap & meer<br data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"751\">✅ Waterdicht tot 50 meter<br data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"779\">✅ In nette staat<br data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"798\">✅ 3 maanden garantie inbegrepen</p>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"874\"><strong data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"874\">Direct draagbaar – beperkt beschikbaar!</strong></p>\r\n<hr class=\"\" data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"879\">\r\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"929\">📋 <strong data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"929\">Specificaties Fitbit Charge 3 – Zwart</strong></h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"1447\">\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"963\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"963\">⌚ <strong data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"945\">Model:</strong> Fitbit Charge 3</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1054\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1054\">❤️ <strong data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"982\">Functies:</strong> Hartslagmeting, stappenteller, calorieën, slaapregistratie, meldingen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1119\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1119\">💧 <strong data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1075\">Waterdicht:</strong> Ja – tot 50 meter (geschikt voor zwemmen)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1191\">📶 <strong data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1144\">Connectiviteit:</strong> Bluetooth – synchroniseert met iOS & Android</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1228\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1228\">🔋 <strong data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1214\">Batterijduur:</strong> Tot 7 dagen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1307\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1307\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1250\">Meegeleverd:</strong> Tracker + polsband (oplaadkabel indien van toepassing)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1331\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1331\">🎨 <strong data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1323\">Kleur:</strong> Zwart</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1408\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1408\">🧼 <strong data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1347\">Staat:</strong> In nette staat – amper gedragen, minimale gebruikerssporen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1447\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1447\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1428\">Garantie:</strong> 3 maanden garantie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
